#
# Counter-example for math:DistributionFamilyShape (Rule P6a): a math:Distribution that
# names NO math:distributionFamily, so that property's sh:minCount 1 fires —
# shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent (math:MissingDistributionParameterization).
# Single violation: it supplies NO math:hasDistributionParameter, so the parametric
# gates math:DistributionParameterizationShape (P6b, SHACL-SPARQL) and
# math:ParameterRoleCardinalityConstraint (P7, SHACL-SPARQL) stay SILENT (both key off a
# supplied parameter / a named parameterization, neither present) — EXACTLY ONE finding.
# Back-reference: math:Distribution / math:MissingDistributionParameterization (slices/grounding/math/module.ttl).
# Bound by tests/example-conformance.ttl (ex:ecDistributionMissingFamilyBad).
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:bareDistribution a math:Distribution .
